    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scheduled Workflows\n\n**CHARACTERISTICS:**\n* Run at predetermined times/intervals\n* Independent of external events\n* Predictable execution pattern\n\n**WHEN TO USE:**\n* Daily reports and reconciliation\n* Periodic data backups\n* Regular health checks\n* End-of-day processing\n\n**SCHEDULE TRIGGER OPTIONS:**\n* Seconds, Minutes, Hours intervals\n* Days, Weeks, Months intervals\n* Custom Cron expressions\n* Timezone-aware execution\n\n**REFERENCE:**\nhttps://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.scheduletrigger/",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c1222974-175c-4677-a6a1-8937e614cebe",
      "name": "Scheduled Pattern",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Event-Driven Workflows\n\n**CHARACTERISTICS:**\n* Triggered by external events\n* Immediate response to actions\n* Unpredictable timing\n\n**WHEN TO USE:**\n* Executing workflows from external sources to perform tasks or process data\n\n**TRIGGER OPTIONS:**\n* Webhook: HTTP endpoints\n* App Triggers: Slack, Sheets, etc.\n* File system watchers\n* Database changes",
        "height": 536,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d64459d9-244c-4fc3-8558-92a7dc7f216a",
      "name": "Event-Driven Pattern",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Choosing the Right Pattern\n\n**USE SCHEDULED FOR:**\n* Batch data processing\n* Periodic reports\n\n**USE EVENT-DRIVEN FOR:**\n* Real-time requirements\n* User interactions\n* External system integrations\n* Immediate notifications",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b128f093-1680-4bba-bff4-1be5745e5fa9",
      "name": "Pattern Comparison",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
