    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Exercise\n\n**TASK: Invent a new tax calculation service!**\n\nIf you run the webhook workflow, you'll notice it fails.  Determine why it failed, and fix it.\n\nThe failed node is supposed to calculate the tax.  Let's assume 10% tax.\n\n1. Execute the workflow. It'll fail.\n2. Open the failed node and read the error message\n3. Fix the error such that it outputs a value that represents cost + tax\n\n\n**SUCCESS CRITERIA:**\n✓ Workflow executes successfully\n✓ Tax is calculated correctly",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "f28d3970-ed60-4da4-9875-08262ba989e0",
      "name": "Exercise",
